this Thai red curry with chicken is one  of my favorite low effort hybrid dishes  and my go-to when I'm teetering on  ordering takeout if you have leftovers  it's even better the next day saute  ginger and garlic then add curry paste  and cook for a few minutes add sliced  chicken thighs cook for a few then add  one can of coconut milk and chicken  broth add zest of half a lime for a  touch of brightness and fish sauce once  chicken is cooked through and liquid is  slightly reduced serve over rice I like  to top it with cilantro and you have  dinner folks enjoy
 

